ta.links","steamMetadata.storageRequirements","steamMetadata.controllerSupport","steamMetadata.playerModes"]}],"confidence":"high","status":"identified","verificationNotes":["The supplied name exactly matches the normalized official Steam name for the supplied App ID."],"research":{"steam":{"status":"success","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T11:23:18.208Z","error":null}},"steamMetadata":{"appId":"1407200","links":{"store":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1407200/","officialWebsite":"https://wargaming.net/wot","support":"https://wargaming.net/support/products/wot"},"storageRequirements":{"kind":"required_free_space","windows":{"minimum":{"value":120,"unit":"GB","display":"120 GB","approximateBytes":120000000000,"evidenceText":"Storage: 120 GB"},"recommended":{"value":120,"unit":"GB","display":"120 GB","approximateBytes":120000000000,"evidenceText":"Storage: 120 GB"}},"macos":{"minimum":null,"recommended":null},"linux":{"minimum":null,"recommended":null},"note":"Steam publishes required free space, not the exact installed or download size."},"controllerSupport":{"level":"unknown","xboxCompatible":null,"xboxEvidence":null,"note":"Generic Steam controller support does not prove Xbox controller compatibility."},"playerModes":{"singlePlayer":false,"multiplayer":true,"coop":false,"onlineCoop":false,"localCoop":false,"lanCoop":false,"sharedOrSplitScreen":false,"pvp":true,"maximumPlayers":null,"maximumPlayersNote":"The public Steam app-details response does not provide a reliable exact player limit.","evidence":["Multi-player","PvP","Online PvP"]},"genres":["Action","Massively Multiplayer","Simulation","Free To Play"],"categories":[{"id":1,"description":"Multi-player"},{"id":20,"description":"MMO"},{"id":49,"description":"PvP"},{"id":36,"description":"Online PvP"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":29,"description":"Steam Trading Cards"},{"id":35,"description":"In-App Purchases"},{"id":66,"description":"Color Alternatives"},{"id":68,"description":"Custom Volume Controls"},{"id":74,"description":"Playable without Timed Input"},{"id":69,"description":"Stereo Sound"},{"id":70,"description":"Surround Sound"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}]}},"content":{"status":"success","steamAppId":"1407200","steamName":"World of Tanks","sourceUrl":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1407200/","fetchedAt":"2026-10-16T08:02:52.706046+00:00","locales":{"en":{"status":"source","provider":"steam","shortDescription":"World of Tanks is a tactical action game with very different gameplay depending on the vehicle type and role. Aside from regular PvP, there are competitive and clan-based modes, special PvE and PvPvE events, and much more. Whether you play to dominate or just enjoy the ride, you'll fit right in.","detailedDescription":"World of Tanks offers something for everyone: Try different tactics, vehicles, and modes!\n\nACTION AND TACTICS\n\nWorld of Tanks has a unique pace. Its armored vehicles are fast enough to draw you into the action, yet slow enough to give you time to think strategically. Good reflexes are always a plus, but it's smart and bold moves that can really turn the tide of a battle. Identify a weak spot in the enemy team's defense, move to an advantageous position at just the right moment, or ambush an opponent—and you'll feel like a champion.\n\nVARIED GAMEPLAY\n\nThe unique pace is yours to control: there are five vehicle types that each play very differently. Generally, light tanks rely on their speed and stealth, heavy tanks on their armor, and mediums on versatility. Tank destroyers (TDs) are feared damage dealers, and self-propelled guns (SPGs) hurl shells at enemies from afar, using an RTS-like view. Almost every one of the 800+ highly detailed vehicles, spread over 11 tiers and 11 nations, feels special.\n\nRESEARCH AND CUSTOMIZATION\n\nBegin with classic tanks and progress toward mighty high-tier machines. Adjust their performance to better suit your unique playstyle with crew perks, equipment, and Field Modification. Top that off with visual customization: showcase each vehicle's unique flair with custom paints, styles, and a wealth of other options.\n\nMODERN GRAPHICS AND SOUND\n\nWorld of Tanks has received multiple and extensive upgrades to its graphics and physics since its launch in 2010. The maps feature unique landmarks and plenty of destructible objects. Vehicles get wet when in water, and they receive shell breaches from enemy rounds that penetrate, as well as pockmarks from rounds that bounce off. Guns and shell explosions have authentic, caliber-dependent sounds, and the acoustic environment is very rich, adding to immersion.\n\nPLENTY OF MODES: PVP AND MORE\n\nThe basic mode is 15v15 Random Battles. Prominent regular modes include Onslaught (7v7 with extra special abilities), Frontline (30v30 on colossal maps with lots of tactical options such as airstrikes), and Steel Hunter (battle royale on mode-specific vehicles with field upgrades). On top of that, there are themed PvE and PvP events with unique rewards, clan-only Global Map and clan-based Strongholds, and more!\n\nBEGINNER-FRIENDLY\n\nWorld of Tanks is hard to master but easy to learn and enjoyable from the get-go. As a rookie, learn the basics from the Bootcamp scenarios, face easier opponents in lower-tier battles, and complete the Tank Academy missions for appealing rewards. A seasoned tanker friend can get you into the Referral Program, bagging great benefits for both of you.","aboutGame":null},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1407200/4cdc7d9c6be74d7c4f91e55a6e0196835ebc17ae/header_alt_assets_27.jpg?t=1792055483"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1407200/d7ebe4d7dfb1fe42c7eb4ded656356199dd4ac82/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1792055483"}],"screenshots":[{